    "northStar": "The Lime Accent System",
    "overview": "This name describes the accent in the current token scaffold; it is not an approved identity for the polling product. The repository combines a shadcn olive-and-lime theme with mostly untouched Vite starter styles. Treat those as implementation evidence, not as a finished or unified visual language.\n\nThe token layer provides semantic light and dark palettes, with a vivid lime primary and restrained olive neutrals. The visible starter layer still supplies generic typography, links, buttons, and spacing. No product-specific interface, brand asset, or distinctive component pattern is implemented yet. There is no confirmed anti-reference.",
